Química Geral I — Feitosa, Barbosa, and Forte (@gc-uece: 0, is #reference, #part-of @gc-sources) { r_7N9JXVMC5DWB8P3MX79YYPHNPA
Edinilza Maria Anastácio Feitosa, Francisco Geraldo Barbosa, and Cristiane Maria Sampaio Forte. Química Geral I, 3ª edição. Fortaleza: EdUECE, 2016. ISBN 978-85-7826-566-3. Português brasileiro. [Institutional record](https://educapes.capes.gov.br/handle/capes/431843) · [Authorized PDF](https://educapes.capes.gov.br/bitstream/capes/431843/2/Livro_Quimica%20Geral%20I.pdf).

Read the whole book as a Portuguese companion for the opening progression: foundations/history, atomic theory, periodicity, matter/energy, bonding, and acid/base theories with nomenclature. It is a first-course companion, not a replacement for the later quantitative/equilibrium programme. The PDF has 136 file pages; the catalogue describes 133 printed pages. Use printed headings and page labels when they differ from file pagination.

The actual title/copyright matter identifies Feitosa, whereas repository metadata renders the first surname as Freitas. The PDF's closing notice states CC BY-SA 4.0; the repository metadata instead lists CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 Brazil. Preserve the actual edition notice and this discrepancy when retaining or reusing it. No copy is bundled. Title page, contents, bibliography, and the two rights statements checked on 29 October 2026.

**Return:** [General chemistry sources — books, courses, data, and research](../Sources.lingua#r_37CHT3QSMD33JDMXE59S6M2ME3).
